 stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5\"/><path d=\"M9 12h6M9 16h6\"/></svg></span><h3>Content Marketing</h3><p>SEO content that builds authority and trust.</p></div><div class=\"sfy-tile r\"><span class=\"sfy-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4v16h16\"/><path d=\"M7 14l3-3 3 3 5-6\"/></svg></span><h3>Analytics</h3><p>Tracking and reporting tied to leads and revenue.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"sfy-sec\"><div class=\"sfy-wrap\"><div class=\"sfy-metrics r\"><div class=\"sfy-metric\"><b>#1</b><span>Ranked for North Goa marketing</span></div><div class=\"sfy-metric\"><b data-to=\"14\" data-suf=\"+\">14+</b><span>Years serving Goa</span></div><div class=\"sfy-metric\"><b data-to=\"500\" data-suf=\"+\">500+</b><span>Projects delivered</span></div><div class=\"sfy-metric\"><b data-to=\"100\" data-suf=\"%\">100%</b><span>In-house team</span></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"sfy-sec\"><div class=\"sfy-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sfy-head r\"><span class=\"sfy-kicker\">Why Sanctify</span><h2>Why North Goa businesses <span class=\"sfy-grad-txt\">choose us</span>.</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"sfy-why\"><div class=\"sfy-wcard r\"><span class=\"sfy-chk\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>\n          <span><b>On the ground in North Goa</b><span>We know Panjim, Calangute and the North Goa market &ndash; not a remote agency guessing.</span></span></div><div class=\"sfy-wcard r\"><span class=\"sfy-chk\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke